    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Coinbase-CEO-Brian-Armstrong-Addresses-Paper-Bitcoin-Claims-Claims-Bitcoin-ETFs-Are-Fully-Backed.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/coinbase-falls-armstrong-sets-up-new-share\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coinbase (COIN) Misses Revenue Estimates as Users Fall, Armstrong Sets Up New Share Sales</a></p>\n<p>Coinbase missed revenue expectations as users declined, despite growth in recurring revenue, while executive share-sale plans and a massive Binance security breach added pressure to crypto markets.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/coinbase-falls-armstrong-sets-up-new-share\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coinbase (COIN) Misses Revenue Estimates as Users Fall, Armstrong Sets Up New Share Sales</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Coinbase-CEO-Brian-Armstrong-Addresses-Paper-Bitcoin-Claims-Claims-Bitcoin-ETFs-Are-Fully-Backed.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/coinbase-falls-armstrong-sets-up-new-share\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coinbase (COIN) Misses Revenue Estimates as Users Fall, Armstrong Sets Up New Share Sales</a></p>\n<p>Coinbase missed revenue expectations as users declined, despite growth in recurring revenue, while executive share-sale plans and a massive Binance security breach added pressure to crypto markets.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/coinbase-falls-armstrong-sets-up-new-share\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coinbase (COIN) Misses Revenue Estimates as Users Fall, Armstrong Sets Up New Share Sales</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
